reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:131:  rule <k> Name(X:String) => #look(X, L) ... </k> <env> L:Int </env>
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-132-  rule <k> #look(X:String, L:Int) => {M[X]}:>Val ... </k>
