  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/proof cleanly and rerun all positive claims
  ✓ Audit adequacy, program pinning, and every local K rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false mutation for non-vacuity
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
